Mining and mineral engineering sources — books, courses, methods, and evidence (@mine-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering) { r_5368N4FVSGP1G4DP5612SJD0M5
Use the source attached to each Record for its actual reading and method. The progression combines substantial English and Portuguese books, full public university lecture sequences, government manuals, primary research, complete case studies, and independent original work. A source's free reading route is distinguished from an open licence or access to every external/campus assessment.

**Mining and ground:** [Introduction to Mining Engineering — Penn State MNG 230](sources/Penn-State-Introduction-to-Mining.lingua#r_5NAY6K47Y4Y61V4JF74JJNV4Q2), [Hard Rock Miner’s Handbook — Jack de la Vergne, fifth edition](sources/Hard-Rock-Miners-Handbook.lingua#r_18YBY5XX4TFS7ZQSKTQMW34EFA), [Surface Mining Technology — Kaushik Dey, NPTEL](sources/Surface-Mining-Technology-NPTEL.lingua#r_5J36XSV6KZRNWX3J51Q4TRV7KG), [Underground Mining of Metalliferous Deposits — Mandal and Dey, NPTEL](sources/Underground-Metalliferous-Mining-NPTEL.lingua#r_5RZCS0BHH0FH6QKFB1V86NXRFJ), [Practical Rock Engineering — Evert Hoek](sources/Practical-Rock-Engineering-Hoek.lingua#r_5VDNJTZ30N76R8Y5DP3T212SGP), [Engineering Geology Field Manual — U.S. Bureau of Reclamation](sources/USBR-Engineering-Geology-Field-Manual.lingua#r_5WS5PNK19008B3SV6D1WWNVTRE), [Pillar and Roof Span Design Guidelines for Underground Stone Mines — NIOSH](sources/NIOSH-Stone-Mine-Pillars-and-Roof-Spans.lingua#r_5PSV3N7QTFG43D1GDG8BWEYW08), and [Design of Surface Mine Haulage Roads — U.S. Bureau of Mines](sources/Surface-Mine-Haulage-Roads-USBM.lingua#r_10NBQN6839CGGK06YZDGCPATXF).

**Processing and integrated plants:** [Tratamento de Minérios — CETEM, sixth edition](sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA), [Tratamento de Minérios: Práticas Laboratoriais — Sampaio, França, and Braga](sources/CETEM-Praticas-Laboratoriais.lingua#r_44AAWXB1D7MBR9B0V3TYB8GF9B), [Usinas de Beneficiamento de Minérios do Brasil — CETEM](sources/CETEM-Usinas-de-Beneficiamento.lingua#r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J), and [Introduction to Mineral Processing — Arun Kumar Majumder, NPTEL](sources/Introduction-to-Mineral-Processing-NPTEL.lingua#r_5VQ67PA1160RQ1EWN17211XBWD). [Wills’ Mineral Processing Technology — Wills and Finch, eighth edition](sources/Wills-Mineral-Processing-Technology.lingua#r_02W7VCEB3274XY5AKSH9SGPV1A), [Principles of Mineral Processing — Fuerstenau and Han](sources/Principles-of-Mineral-Processing-SME.lingua#r_71VWXMG9R3MYJ2QWA8QKEPPGMY), and [SME Mining Engineering Handbook — Peter Darling, third edition](sources/SME-Mining-Engineering-Handbook.lingua#r_4Y1TJWVHWWCYTYAKZKMAEAVX25) are separately identified commercial references accessed through an authorized library or purchase.

**Evidence, models, and planning:** [Geostatistical sampling, continuity, estimation, and simulation — Deutsch and contributors](sources/Geostatistical-Declustering-and-Variograms.lingua#r_1MDWJYNM88E34YCM4918C7DEEQ), [Resources, reserves, and technical-study definitions — CRIRSCO and CBRR](sources/Resource-and-Reserve-Reporting-CRIRSCO-CBRR.lingua#r_2CZZ64T1W8VC542VCNCH2E6DSR), [A Review of Operations Research in Mine Planning — Newman and colleagues](sources/Operations-Research-in-Mine-Planning.lingua#r_3WX1KW34EWEGYZ6HGEMGGQBKHS), and [MineLib — Espinoza, Goycoolea, Moreno, and Newman](sources/MineLib-Benchmarks-and-Methods.lingua#r_3KXVJNVZ2FSQ8CZJMJG2JDQYR8). Read complete primary methods rather than using a course outline as evidence that a research result is understood.

**Water, environment, lifecycle, and work:** [Subsurface Ventilation Engineering — Malcolm J. McPherson](sources/McPherson-Subsurface-Ventilation.lingua#r_3KH110VQV6VEA56FVWV8D7W6AY), [Handbook for Dust Control in Mining — NIOSH](sources/NIOSH-Dust-Control-in-Mining.lingua#r_12DGN33X5RSS7664BNT1QM5C52), [Water stewardship — Australian leading-practice handbook](sources/Mine-Water-Stewardship-Handbook.lingua#r_4Y8Q03RFJBVBN6WVVY3EN6Q5DM), [Preventing acid and metalliferous drainage — leading-practice handbook](sources/Preventing-Acid-and-Metalliferous-Drainage.lingua#r_7SDBPF4TAZV9GKDCTW9BTYJ43R), [Tailings management — Australian leading-practice handbook](sources/Tailings-Management-Leading-Practice.lingua#r_40NN1207ZCBP7RVX690CP4G7HZ), [Global Industry Standard on Tailings Management — Global Tailings Review](sources/Global-Industry-Standard-on-Tailings-Management.lingua#r_2S0TS7YDGRXD4EFA14DWNQ351S), [Mine closure — Australian leading-practice handbook](sources/Mine-Closure-Leading-Practice.lingua#r_2GYS4C9MHF2CRD8253QPDEV3QN), [Mine rehabilitation — Australian leading-practice handbook](sources/Mine-Rehabilitation-Leading-Practice.lingua#r_4RS2D5ZYYW6Q7EG62C4VDWGWYQ), [Community engagement and development — Australian leading-practice handbook](sources/Community-Engagement-and-Development-Handbook.lingua#r_2RSVNSY8QJJ3XF6YGJ7TBADM89), and [NR-22 — Segurança e Saúde Ocupacional na Mineração](sources/NR-22-Mineracao.lingua#r_2MFMFMPEV36SZGMYM8YAZYEQHK).

Identity, editions, contents, rights, and access were checked against primary sources on 29 October 2026 where available. Source Records preserve dated guidance, edition differences, automated-access limits, and the distinction between a publisher's metadata and actual full-text inspection. Use the actual current primary requirements when a practical study depends on them. No source books, articles, PDFs, datasets, media, or external software are bundled.

